  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Waveshare ESP32-S3 display development board with a 4.3-inch 800x480 capacitive touch LCD, Wi-Fi/Bluetooth connectivity, CAN, RS485, I2C, a TF card slot, and USB Type-C. This entry selects the version with touch function.\n\nSelect only touch SKU 25948; the shop also lists no-touch SKU 30493. This model is for ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4.3, not the distinct 4.3B/4.3C products. The official ZIP contains esp32-s3-touch-lcd-4_3.stp without an explicit hardware revision. The configurable shop page does not establish a reliable exact per-SKU price."
    }
